sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Overview Screen
    participant B as Articles Service
    participant J as Jobs Service
    participant P as Platform APIs (Medium · Hashnode · Dev.to)

    UI->>B: POST /api/articles/{id}/push { "platforms": ["medium", "hashnode"] }
    B->>B: create job_id; set destination status → pending; append TimelineEvent
    B-->>UI: 202 { jobId: "job_xxx", status: "running" }
    UI->>UI: show spinner on destination pills

    Note over B,P: background job runs (simulated sync in dev backend)
    B->>P: POST article content to each platform API
    P-->>B: draft created (or error)
    B->>B: update destination status → draft | error; append TimelineEvent per outcome
    B->>B: mark job_id → done

    loop every 2 s (max 60 s)
        UI->>J: GET /api/jobs/job_xxx
        alt running
            J-->>UI: { status: "running" }
        else done
            J-->>UI: { status: "done", result: { platforms: ["medium","hashnode"] } }
            UI->>B: GET /api/articles?page=… (refresh)
            B-->>UI: updated list with new destination pills
        else error
            J-->>UI: { status: "error", error: "Medium push failed — auth expired" }
            UI->>UI: show error toast; refresh article row
        end
    end